 customers or any homeowner interested in becoming one. </p> \n\n<h2>My Account</h2>\n\n\n<p><strong>My Account ... the Better Way to Manage Your NJNG Account </strong></p>\n<p>Your customer online portal transforms the self-service experience to make interactions with us <strong>easy, personalized and meaningful</strong>. Make payments on the go, compare and analyze your natural gas usage, submit and track service requests and more. And that’s just the beginning. <a href=\"https://myaccount.njng.com/Portal/default.aspx\" title=\"My Account Login\">Log in or register</a> and start managing your NJNG account like a pro!</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<a href=\"/index.aspx\"> Home</a><a href=\"/contactus/index.aspx\">Contact Us</a><a href=\"myaccount.njng.com\">FAQs</a><a href=\"/sitemap/index.aspx\">Site Map</a><a href=\"//www.njresources.com/privacy/index.aspx\">Privacy Statement</a><a href=\"https://www.njresources.com/terms/index.aspx\">Terms of Use</a><a href=\"www.njng.com\">Your Ad Choices</a><a href=\"/safety/utility-scam-alert.aspx\">Fraud Alert</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NewJerseyNaturalGas\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Facebook Page opens in a new window\"><img alt=\"Facebook Page\" src=\"/images/about/Facebook_30.png\"/></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/NJNaturalGas\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"X Page opens in a new window\"><img alt=\"X Page\" src=\"/common-assets/images/footer/logo-x-black.png\"/></a><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/njnglife\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Instagram Page opens in a new window\"><img alt=\"Instagram Page\" src=\"/images/about/Instagram_30.png\"/></a><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://get.adobe.com/reader/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Adobe Reader link opens in a new window.\">Click here to get Adobe® Acrobat Reader®.</a>Copyright © 2025 New Jersey Resources. All rights reserved.\n\t\t\t    \n <a class=\"logo\" href=\"/index.asp\" shape=\"rect\"><img alt=\"NJR Home Services\" src=\"/common-assets/images/header/logos/njng